ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh044 - Shell edge appears once but should appear twice (free edge)
 * Defect: shell-orientation check must distinguish free edges (legal
 * boundary of an open shell) from edges that should be shared but are
 * not (genuine non-watertight defect). Each edge appears exactly once
 * in this fixture. */
